"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F279409741923107_122257111430281105+-+Remember+in+2024+when+my+opponent+encouraged+voters+to+vote+%E2%80%9CNO%E2%80%9D+on+Proposition+1+with+inflammatory+language+targeting+trans+individuals%3F+Not+only+was+he+disenfranchising+trans+youth%2C+but+he+was+also+sidestepping+the+real+issue+for+which+Proposition+1+was+created%3A+protecting+a+woman%E2%80%99s+right+to+her+own+medical+decisions%2C+including+%E2%80%93+you+guessed+it+%E2%80%93+reproductive+rights.+The+proposition+passed+without+his+support.His+voting+record+does+not+support+women.+Earlier+this+year+he+voted+against+protecting+healthcare+providers+and+patients+%E2%80%93+women+%E2%80%93+when+he+voted+against+a+bill+that+would+protect+them+from+criminal+charges+when+prescribing%2C+dispensing%2C+or+receiving+mifepristone+or+any+drug+used+for+medication+abortion.+The+bill+passed+without+his+support+and+is+headed+to+the+governor%E2%80%99s+desk.Earlier+this+year+he+also+sponsored+legislation+that+would+require+parental+notice+prior+to+performing+an+abortion+upon+an+unemancipated+minor.+In+2024+he+was+%E2%80%9Cworried%E2%80%9D+about+young+girls+having+to+play+sports+alongside+trans+youth%2C+but+this+year+he%E2%80%99s+not+worried+about+them+having+to+carry+an+unwanted+pregnancy+and+face+increased+medical+emergencies+or+death%3F+This+legislation+was+dead+on+the+floor.His+votes+are+about+controlling+women+and+their+right+to+choose%2C+not+protecting+them.I+will+protect+personal+choice+because+healthcare+decisions+should+stay+between+you+and+your+doctors%2C+not+reactionary+politicians+in+Albany."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
